#
# Warm light scheme: classic bevels on a sand-colored face with cream views and muted slate-blue
# accents. Loosely inspired by popular low-contrast warm palettes, kept well desaturated.
#
# No [Colors:Header] group on purpose: when it exists, KWin paints title bars with the Header
# colors instead of [WM], and apps fall back to the Window colors anyway.

